  situationName: The Hidden Figure's Purpose Becomes Clear
  act: Keep still and continue observing the hidden figure.
  situationDescription: After a long wait, the figure steps into a clearer stretch
    of the road where you can make out a trader's satchel and several sealed bundles.
    They check the road against a worn route marker, then head toward a nearby settlement.
    The goods and direction give you a useful clue about current merchant movement.
